# toolchain (webpack, babel, webpack-dev-server). keyway-docs is a static site
# (`docusaurus build`) deployed to docs.keyway.sh — none of this code is shipped
# to visitors' browsers, and the dev-server deps (shell-quote, websocket-driver,
# ws) only run locally under `docusaurus start`. No production runtime exposure.
# Re-review on expiry; drop an entry once Docusaurus ships a patched toolchain.
